# Semantic content of the header page: values, relations and properties.
# The presence of each name and type comes with the Tier 0 generator.

assertion  XBD.stdbool.h.001
anchor     basedefs/stdbool.h.html#DESCRIPTION/bool
class      required
since      2001
says       bool expands to _Bool, true to the integer constant 1, false to the
           integer constant 0, and __bool_true_false_are_defined to the integer
           constant 1.
test       t/001-bool-macros.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

assertion  XBD.stdbool.h.002
anchor     basedefs/stdbool.h.html#DESCRIPTION/true
class      required
since      2024
says       true, false and __bool_true_false_are_defined are suitable for use in
           #if directives.
test       t/002-bool-in-if.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants
